# Designated reviewers for governance-critical paths.
#
# Rationale (red-team finding RT-1): the gk-007 workflow runs with
# repository secrets on same-repo pull requests, and GitHub evaluates
# the workflow file from the PR head. Without a required reviewer on
# .github/, any actor with write access can land a workflow edit that
# reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY. CODEOWNERS is only enforced when the
# branch ruleset requires code-owner review — see docs.

